        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SSP1810, 18 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 18 Inch Contemporary Pull is a great way to update any space. Its modern, clean look paired with the hottest finishes in today's design trends make this 18 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull a must have for almost any door. It comes packaged with mounting hardware for wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. So go ahead and get one for your glass shower door and your front door paired with a <a href=\"/products/contemporary-stainless-steel-deadbolt-ahi-4750\">matching deadbolt</a>. And since it is made out of durable stainless steel, the Contemporary 18 Inch Door Handle can be used in commercial as well as residential applications. \r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSP1810-specifications.gif?v=1704354502\" width=\"600\" height=\"165\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" atl=\"Deltana SSP1810 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-18-inch-contemporary-pulls-pair-deltana-sspbb1810\"><b>Deltana SSPBB1810 Contemporary 18\" Back-to-Back Pulls</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Square Stainless Steel Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 1\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 2-1/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for glass, fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SSP1810-specifciations.pdf?v=1704262342\"><b>Deltana SSP1810 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
