                "title": "18 Inch Contemporary Pull",
                "description": "The 18 Inch Contemporary Pull is a great way to update any space. Its modern, clean look paired with the hottest finishes in today's design trends make this 18 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull a must have for almost any door. It comes packaged with mounting hardware for wood, metal, or glass doors. Since it is made out of durable stainless steel, the Contemporary 18 Inch Door Handle can be used in commercial as well as residential applications.",
